MORE EXAMPLES ON THE WEB

Every kind of chart and diagram has a small, correct example at https://raw.githubusercontent.com/binary-dice-games/nymph/refs/heads/main/examples/NAME.yaml where NAME is one of: {{example-names}}. For a type not shown above, open the matching file first and copy its structure exactly. Do not open docs/elements.md: it is far too long.
